WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.370
"Tokyo"

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:13.870
What a long road it's been...

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:15.120
"Reiji Mukudori"

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.250
On July 15, 2043,

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:26.500
the virtual reality massively multiplayer online
game <i>Infinite Dendrogram</i> was released worldwide.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.330
Here goes!

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:49.040
Hello! And welcome!

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.370
A cat?

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:57.160
Pardon the intrusion.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.080
Mmm, nice.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.750
I like people with good manners.

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:06.160
Oh, I'm control AI no. 13, Cheshire.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.330
Pleasure!

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:09.500
Ah, same here.

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:14.000
First you'll need a player name. What'll it be?

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.790
Ray Starling.

00:01:15.790 --> 00:01:19.750
Just a twist on my first name
plus the English for my last name.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.870
You got it.

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:27.580
Next, choose your looks and
equipment to make your avatar.

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:25.830
"Eye Size" "Pupil Size"
"Eye Tilt" "Eyelash Length"

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:31.200
Can I keep the default realistic look,
just tweak it a little?

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:32.790
You sure can.

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:39.620
Then I'll start with this,
change the hair color and stuff, and...

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.080
Yep! That'll work!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.000
Okay!

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:50.950
Oof!

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:55.540
That's an item box. It contains
your initial traveling expenses:

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:57.500
Five coins totaling 5,000 lir.

00:01:57.500 --> 00:01:59.790
Wow...

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:02.870
Now to implant your Embryo.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.790
Ooh! I've heard of these!

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.370
Here goes...

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:19.290
All set! Implantation complete!

00:02:19.290 --> 00:02:21.580
That's the zeroth form of your Embryo.

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:25.330
You can remove it once it
hatches into its first form.

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:31.450
After that, it'll undergo a completely different
evolution so it can match you personally.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:34.620
The possibilities are endless!

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:37.870
Endless possibilities...

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:42.000
Roughly speaking, you've got these categories:

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.160
The tool-shaped Type Arms.

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:49.120
The monster-shaped Type Guardian.

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:52.120
The vehicle-shaped Type Chariot.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:55.080
The building-shaped Type Castle.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:58.580
And the boundary-shaped Type Territory.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.580
So many kinds!

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:05.200
There are rare types and high-end types
that these five can evolve into.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:09.750
Plus one unique category.
Maybe you'll get that one!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:11.950
Good to meet you, partner.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:17.160
And finally, choose your in-game nationality.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.370
I'll take the Kingdom of Altar.

00:03:25.870 --> 00:03:28.410
"Kingdom of Altar"

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:28.410
Gotcha.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:32.870
Let me just send you right
to its capital, Altea.

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:36.700
Oh--what goal should I be
working toward in this game?

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:38.120
Anything you like!

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:39.290
Anything?

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:45.080
You can be a hero or a villain,
a king or a lackey,

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.950
a do-gooder or a ne'er-do-well.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:53.620
Do something or do nothing,
stay in <i>Infinite Dendrogram</i> or leave it--

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:55.370
it's all up to you.

00:03:55.370 --> 00:03:58.000
Do anything you like, if it can be done.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:02.660
Like your Embryo, you, too, are embarking
on a journey of endless possibility.

00:04:02.660 --> 00:04:05.950
Welcome to <i>Infinite Dendrogram</i> !

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:09.450
We're so glad you're here.

00:04:09.450 --> 00:04:10.540
Huh?

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:17.120
Whoa!

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:27.790
And so... I entered the world
of <i>Infinite Dendrogram</i> .

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.870
I'm gonna crash!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:53.870
"Chapter 1: The Beginning of Possibility"

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:57.410
I thought I was a goner...

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:02.120
It's real.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:32.620
Wow. This is a <i>game</i> ?

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:38.040
Now let's see... I was supposed to meet
my brother at the big fountain.

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:41.750
If I keep going straight-- Huh?

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.000
"Ray Starling"

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:47.000
"Left Arm: Broken"

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:51.040
"Right Arm: Broken"
"Left Arm: Broken"
"Ray Starling"

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.120
Are you all right?

00:05:51.120 --> 00:05:52.580
Force Heal!

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:57.540
"Ray Starling"

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:07.160
I'm actually healed!

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:09.750
I'm so sorry! Are you okay?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.790
I'm fine.

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:15.290
You seemed to be in a real hurry.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:20.040
As it happens, I was looking
for my little sister.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.620
Have you seen her anywhere?

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:27.660
Sorry--I just got here.

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:30.160
I see...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:33.580
Then maybe... she's already gone in.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:38.160
Here, this is how you can contact me.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:42.540
If you see my sister, please let me know!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:49.410
"Altar Knight of the Royal Guard"...

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:52.580
Huh? I don't know this language,
but I can read it.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:56.950
Let's see. "Vice Commander Liliana Grandria."

00:06:58.540 --> 00:06:59.540
Hmm?

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:06.660
Triggered level 5 quest: Find Milianne Grandria.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.500
A quest?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:12.370
Seriously? I thought she was another player.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:15.500
That was an NPC?!

00:07:16.750 --> 00:07:21.450
Level 5... Is that for a high-level
player with a full party?

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:24.830
Why would I trigger such a difficult quest?

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.660
I better ask my brother.

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.580
He should be around here somewhere...

00:07:35.580 --> 00:07:45.830
Grizz, grizz, grizz, grizz, grizz!
Grizz, grizz, grizz, grizz, grizz!

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:43.450
"Welcome, Little Bro"

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.370
One balloon each, now, grizz.

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:51.910
What a big ol' bear! Wow!

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.910
Excuse me--can I ask you something?

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:54.040
Yes, grizz-grizz?

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.160
"Grizz-grizz"?

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:59.250
Is that you, Shuichi--big brother?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.410
Indeed it is. Hey, Reiji.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:04.450
Here you go, grizz!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:08.910
Thanks, Mister Bear!

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:11.160
Grizz-grizz!

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:17.000
Let's start with introductions.
My name here is Shu Starling.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.540
I'm Ray Starling.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.080
Figures you'd be wearing a costume.

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:26.290
So what do you want to do?
Can I show you around town?

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:29.250
Well, about that...

00:08:29.250 --> 00:08:35.500
Ooh, Liliana's quest.
Even I've never taken that one on.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:36.950
Is she famous?

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:40.750
Liliana might be the most popular
person in this country.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:44.450
Has a fan club and everything,
with players and tians alike.

00:08:44.450 --> 00:08:46.250
A fan club, huh?

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:48.620
Wait, what's a tian?

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:50.790
It's the generic term for NPCs, grizz.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:54.620
So even NPCs can join fan clubs?

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:59.500
For admin reasons, tians have human-grade
cognitive capabilities and personalities,

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:00.620
so, yeah, it's not unusual.

00:09:00.620 --> 00:09:06.750
Wow. But why would a level-0 guy
like me get such a famous tian's quest?

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:11.540
This is a realistic world. There are no
conditions for triggering a quest--

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.830
they can crop up when stuff just... happens.

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:18.330
Which means there's an
infinite number of quests.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:24.120
Hey, did that quest mention
where you should look?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:28.790
Like a hint? I have this note, I guess.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:33.200
Take a look.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.290
"Dear Sissy,

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:41.040
Remberries were the only thing the shop
didn't have, so I'm going to get some.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:44.410
Don't worry--I have insect repellent.

00:09:44.410 --> 00:09:46.160
Just sit tight, okay?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:47.790
Love, Mili."

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:48.870
Is this...?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:53.330
Liliana must have been flustered
to write on the back of her sister's note.

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:56.080
This isn't good.

00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:57.120
Huh?

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.200
She mentions insect repellent, right?

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.450
Yeah...

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:05.410
If she's bringing insect repellent,
she's probably gone to Old Reve Orchard,

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.080
outside the capital.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.500
What's so bad about that?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:16.750
Old Reve Orchard is in ruins,
overrun by insect monsters.

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:19.870
Now it's just one big monster lair.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.120
We've got to finish this, and fast.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:26.450
I bet it's the kind of quest you automatically
fail after X amount of time.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.660
What's that mean?

00:10:28.660 --> 00:10:32.830
In this world, there's no guarantee
that the quest tians will be safe

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:35.290
until the player finishes the quest.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.250
Not like the old days.

00:10:40.500 --> 00:10:43.250
And when a tian dies, they're dead for good.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:49.000
We've lost heroes, sages,
knight captains--even this nation's king.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:54.040
Yet the world of <i>Infinite Dendrogram</i>
keeps on turning without a hitch.

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:56.160
It's that realistic.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:11:00.700
I know she's an NPC... but still...

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.290
That leaves a bad taste in my mouth.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:04.500
Right?

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:09.080
So let's finish this quest.
We'll shoot for a happy ending!

00:11:10.750 --> 00:11:11.910
Yeah.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.870
Begin quest!

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:20.620
This is where we rush on in...

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:25.620
...but since you're level 0 and jobless,
I'm gonna give you some items, grizz.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:31.250
"Dragonscale Ward"
"Dragonscale Ward"

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:31.250
Equip those and they'll save
your life five times, grizz. And...

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:35.450
"Accept"   "Decline"

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:35.450
You've been invited to join
Shu Sterling's party.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:39.910
It's easier for me to cover you if I can
keep an eye on your status, grizz.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:42.500
Got it.

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:45.870
What's the penalty for dying
in this game, anyway?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.620
A 24-hour login lockout.

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:52.500
What? So you can't play for 24 hours?

00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:55.830
That's not what's so awful about it.

00:11:55.830 --> 00:12:00.750
Those 24 locked-out hours equal 72 hours here,

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:07.250
so if you're mid-quest like we are,
you're abandoning your quest for three days.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:10.870
That's a frightening prospect
in such a realistic world.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.540
I know I don't have to spell
the rest out for you.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.870
I'll follow your lead so I won't die.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:19.000
Now let's go save the girl, grizz!

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.910
Yeah! Let's do this!

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.910
They just keep coming!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:33.700
S-Sissy...

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:41.870
At this rate, I'll never be able
to keep Milianne safe...

00:12:48.370 --> 00:12:52.160
Have a taste of Baldr's second form, grizz!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:55.660
Why, you're--

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:58.750
The cavalry has arrived, grizz!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:01.200
Are you okay?

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:04.450
That fellow from before--what brings you here?

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:05.870
And you, too?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:07.250
My little bro here was like,

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:10.580
"I can't just ignore this!
I'll rescue her, no matter what!"

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:13.200
So I tagged along to help, grizz.

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:14.330
I never said that!

00:13:14.330 --> 00:13:16.870
His little brother? So that's why--

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:23.080
Thank you. Mili would have been in
real danger if you hadn't shown up.

00:13:23.080 --> 00:13:25.330
I won't forget your kindness.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:28.830
I-I just watched. I didn't do anything.

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:33.950
L-Let's get out of here. We don't want
to be caught up in another swarm.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.700
    "Ray Starling"                   "Shu Starling"
   "Milianne Grandria"           "Liliana Grandria"

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.700
An NPC has joined your party.

00:13:39.000 --> 00:13:44.000
Level 210?! You've left me in the dust.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:45.910
Ray?

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:54.580
At first I thought this quest was high-level
because it had a time limit.

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:57.790
But we've killed the insects
and reunited with these two,

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.750
and the quest hasn't ended.

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:01.200
What do you mean?

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.410
What I mean is...

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:09.000
This is a level-5 quest because
level-210 Liliana is part of it.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.200
Tch!

00:14:19.750 --> 00:14:21.700
A Demi-Drag-Worm!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:26.790
Another one!

00:14:26.790 --> 00:14:28.620
I get it now.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:32.870
If you're going to keep a girl safe
from multiple Demi-Dragon monsters,

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:36.450
this difficulty level makes sense
with a helper in your party.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:41.870
But you're no match at all
when you're up against <i>me</i> !

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:45.790
I could just pound you to smithereens,
but since we're here...

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:48.450
Baldr! Fourth form, activate!

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:54.330
Huh? Whoa, whoa, whoa--are you
freezing me in place, grizz? No fair, grizz!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:56.330
Grizz!

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:57.620
Bro!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.790
Shu!

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.040
Look out!

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.290
I have a favor to ask.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:14.120
Huh?

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:19.750
I'll handle this. Just--please,
take my sister somewhere safe.

00:15:23.620 --> 00:15:27.750
At level 0, I'll just slow her down...

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:31.200
Understood. I'll get her
to the exit safe and sound.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.830
Thank you.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:39.160
Why'd you come all the way here
for remberries, Mili?

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:46.410
Today's Sissy's birthday. I was going to make
her a remberry cake. They're her favorite.

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.410
Huh.

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:51.080
But the shops didn't have a single one.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:54.910
And the man with glasses, he gave me repellent.

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:59.660
He said that would let me go pick
remberries in the orchard.

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.950
So it's the glasses guy's fault.

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:05.580
What was he thinking, sending a kid
to a dangerous place like this?

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.580
He needs a good smack!

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:14.250
All right. If we can just make it there--

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:31.330
Checkmate, huh?

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:39.910
She's a tian. If she dies, she's gone for good.

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:44.500
And <i>that</i> ... leaves a bad taste in my mouth!

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:51.410
"Equipped Lifesaving Brooch"

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:56.120
Mili, can you run to the exit
from here all by yourself?

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.370
Huh?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:01.870
I've got to give that nasty
centipede a good beating.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:10.790
"Dragonscale Ward"

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:13.250
"Ray Starling"

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:18.160
Good thing I kept pain sensation set to "off."

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:23.000
"Ray Starling"

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.580
Go! I'll figure something out!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:29.950
Run!

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:37.040
"Dragonscale Ward"

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:44.450
Gotta buy some time somehow...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.250
"Starling"

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:54.080
You trying to kill me? You've got
three more chances, you big bug!

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:00.660
"Dragonscale Ward"

00:18:03.700 --> 00:18:05.330
Not yet...

00:18:07.620 --> 00:18:11.250
It's not over yet, damn you!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:16.500
Hey! What are you looking at?

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:18.000
Wait up!

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:27.000
Stop!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:39.250
"Dragonscale Ward"

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:43.450
Mili!

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:49.540
She's alive! All thanks to
that Lifesaving Brooch.

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:53.000
But now that my last Dragonscale
has been destroyed...

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.620
...I have no way to withstand
that thing's attacks.

00:18:56.620 --> 00:18:58.200
Dammit!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:04.370
I can't give up. To me, this world is just
a game. I can die--no problem.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:07.250
But even if it <i>is</i> a game,

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:11.200
for this girl to be lost
from this world forever?

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.160
That leaves a bad taste in my mouth!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:19.290
Hey. Embryo.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:23.500
If you really do offer endless possibilities...

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.830
Hand 'em over!

00:19:24.830 --> 00:19:30.700
The possibility of a happy ending--
of saving this child!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:32.250
Give it to me now!

00:19:32.250 --> 00:19:36.200
Open your eyes this instant
and give me even one percent...

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:39.500
...of your endless possibilities!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:49.000
You're clingier than I'd expected, Master.

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:54.330
But I don't hate that.

00:19:59.540 --> 00:20:01.040
Good morning.

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:06.160
Yeesh, what kind of face is that?

00:20:09.910 --> 00:20:12.290
You're my...

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:13.790
...Embryo.

00:20:14.790 --> 00:20:16.080
Now, then!

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:21.330
I bet finishing off that rotten bug with a bang
would really liven up my big debut.

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:22.450
Huh?!

00:20:25.040 --> 00:20:27.950
What? Wh-What's this?

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:37.000
A s-sword?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:42.000
The timing is all yours. Bring the sword
down when the bug charges.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:47.830
I've given you the possibility, Master.
The rest is up to you.

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:53.620
Got it!

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:59.290
Of your four attacks,
my Master nearly died three times.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:03.200
The fourth time, I absorbed the blow.
It's payback time.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:10.830
Vengeance is Mine!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.870
Success! Well done!

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:40.330
Good for you, Master. You got
the possibility you were hoping for.

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:51.910
I'm Nemesis, your Embryo: Type Maiden-Arms.

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:56.120
I was born of your body, heart, and soul.

00:21:57.620 --> 00:22:01.620
Pleased to meet you, Master.

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:05.580
Sissy!

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:05.580
Mili!

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:10.330
Oh, thank goodness. And thank <i>you</i> !

00:22:10.330 --> 00:22:15.540
Thank you so much for keeping my sister safe.

00:22:15.540 --> 00:22:21.540
Yes, you should be thanking
my Master--and, really, me.

00:22:21.540 --> 00:22:26.540
I see you, too, are a Master
chosen by your Embryo.

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:30.450
But... "Maiden"? Isn't that--?

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:39.750
All right! Escaped the underground, grizz!

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.160
Thank you!

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:44.290
You're welcome, Mili.

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:47.450
This debt will not go unpaid.

00:22:55.330 --> 00:23:00.250
Quest: Find Milianne Grandria complete.

00:23:01.580 --> 00:23:02.870
It's over...

00:23:02.870 --> 00:23:05.250
Our reward is a single remberry?

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:07.830
Pretty paltry pay for all that hard work.

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:11.790
It's more than enough reward for me.

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:16.660
Mmm! It's delicious!

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:19.500
There's more where that came from, grizz.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:22.200
Since it's your first day and all,

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:26.540
I've prepared a feast with
remberries for dessert, grizz!

00:23:26.540 --> 00:23:31.700
I hit the markets early and bought them all out,
so eat as many as you want, grizz.

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:34.000
Hey! Bear!

00:23:35.160 --> 00:23:41.660
-You started this whole thing, Brother Bear!

00:23:38.660 --> 00:23:41.660
Grizz!

00:23:43.870 --> 00:23:48.370
"Tomb Labyrinth"

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:47.080
"Tomb Labyrinth"
